      "text": "During construction, general main-entrance access ends at 5:00 p.m., and the third-floor rear entrance is closed; staff and facilities/construction personnel must use the designated staff entrance. The existing accessible route is unavailable, but a temporary route beside the main entrance remains available to the first-floor lobby. Authorized students entering after 5:00 p.m. must use a physical NFC card, not the app. Guidance may prioritize closures and should proactively redirect library users, habitual rear-route users, and visiting groups."
